<title>CROATIA: Croatian c.bank says injects HRK117 mln repo funds.</title>
<headline>Croatian c.bank says injects HRK117 mln repo funds.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Croatia's central bank said it injected 117 million kuna through a bill repurchase operation on Wednesday to help the banking sector liquidity.</p>
<p>The deal runs until May 26 and the funds are repayable at 9.0 percent. The bank drained almost 190 million kuna today from last week's repo intervention. -- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
